      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i run a manufacturing plant in ohio and we're getting hit hard by these new carbon emission standards coming up. i have a meeting with our local reps next week to push back on this. can you give me a solid list of arguments i can use against these new regulations to show how much they're gonna hurt local businesses?",
