      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it's a really strong point. looking at the other side though, my reps are going to try to hit me with the \"the environment is more important than profits\" or \"we have to do this for future generations\" angle. how should i respond to those? i want to make sure i don't sound like i'm just ignoring the environmental side, but i need to show why their arguments are unrealistic for manufacturing.",
